# Reads the opening of the Japanese original with mining on (docs/MINING.md).
# START, clicks through the opening film (the first line appears near frame 19200),
# 30 lines at one click every 2.5 seconds, 60 clicks 0.1 seconds apart, 15 lines,
# ten seconds of the skip key, 30 lines. At frame 21030 the app goes to the background
# for a second, half a second into a long line.
